mentor/wp-content/uploads/sites/71/2026/04/7-opt.mp4\" playsinline loop muted autoplay></video>			\n							<video src=\"http://dummy.xtemos.com/woodmart2/keyboards-elementor/wp-content/uploads/sites/71/2026/04/4-opt.mp4\" playsinline loop muted autoplay></video>', 'HMX YG Macchiato Linear Switches', 'https://divinikey.com/collections/switches/products/hmx-yg-macchiato-linear-switches', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'hmx-yg-macchiato-linear-switches', '', '', '2026-04-10 13:45:42', '2026-04-10 13:45:42', '', 0, 'https://dummy.xtemos.com/woodmart2/keyboards-elementor/?post_type=product&amp;p=221', 0, 'product', '', 0),
