one. A series of ribs surround the phone and are specifically designed to direct force away from the device during an impact. We even leave room for you to apply a screen protector, giving you that extra comfort.</p>\n			<a href=\"#\">\n					Questions &amp; Answers				\n							</a>\n								<img width=\"1320\" height=\"880\" src=\"http://localhost/asset-blog/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/accessories-single-product-3-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />					\n						 			\n										\n					<img width=\"1200\" height=\"801\" src=\"http://localhost/asset-blog/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/accessories-single-product-4-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />				\n				<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XHOmBV4js_E\"></a>\n				<h4>Materials</h4> \n			<p>We’ve been working on perfecting bioplastics that feel good, wear well, and compost when you’re finished using them as a phone case. You’ll find the same great material in our iPhone Bio Case.</p><p>Our bioplastic is verified to meet U.S. (ASTM D6400-04) and E.U. (EN13432) standards for compostability. It means you can toss your case in the city compost bin when you upgrade your phone.</p>\n						 					\n															<img width=\"65\" height=\"65\" src=\"http://dummy.xtemos.com/woodmart2/accessories-elementor/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2022/09/acs-ab-us-img-avatar-65x65.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />													\n											<h4 class=\"info-box-title title box-title-style-default wd-fontsize-m\" data-elementor-setting-key=\"title\">\n								Brooklyn Simmons						</h4>\n					<p>BARONE LLC</p>', 'Epik Silicone Case Full – Deep Navy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'epik-silicone-case-full-deep-navy', '', '', '2022-09-15 13:15:04', '2022-09-15 13:15:04', '', 0, 'http://dummy.xtemos.com/woodmart2/accessories-elementor/?post_type=product&amp;p=9186', 0, 'product', '', 0),
